[00:22.04]1. God’s Kingdom rules from above.
[00:28.84]All praise his Son, the beloved.
[00:34.26]Christ reigns in Zion, the chief cornerstone.
[00:46.42]Let us all lift up our voice.
[00:51.82]Sing to our God, and rejoice.
[00:57.42]Christ, Lord and Savior,
[01:01.54]has been placed upon His throne.
[01:07.84](Chorus)
[01:08.24]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[01:14.60]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[01:20.20]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[01:26.04]Eternal life and happiness.
[01:32.10]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[01:36.88]For his love and faithfulness.
[01:57.40]2. Christ now in power is here,
[02:03.96]And Armageddon is near.
[02:09.30]Satan’s old system will soon pass away.
[02:19.60]Now is the season to preach.
[02:27.50]Many there are yet to reach;
[02:31.04]Time for the meek
[02:35.54]to take their stand for Him today.
[02:43.34](Chorus)
[02:43.34]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[02:49.32]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[02:54.78]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[03:00.58]Eternal life and happiness.
[03:05.94]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[03:11.64]For his love and faithfulness.
[03:28.76]3. God’s reigning Ruler we prize.
[03:34.42]Wondrous he is in our eyes.
[03:39.90]He comes in God’s name; we bow to our King.
[03:50.92]Enter the grand temple gate;
[03:56.18]God’s favor now supplicate.
[04:00.96]Soon dawns that day
[04:04.52]when he rules over ev’rything.
[04:11.50](Chorus)
[04:12.70]What will you bring, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[04:18.58]Triumph of truth and righteousness.
[04:23.58]And bring what else, Jehovah’s Kingdom?
[04:29.94]Eternal life and happiness.
[04:35.74]Praise the Universal Sov’reign
[04:42.00]For his love and faithfulness.
